  "id": "BIT-ghost-2026-103292",
  "summary": "Ghost 0.5.3 before 6.50.0 Cross-Site Scripting via ghost_head",
  "details": "Ghost versions from 0.5.3 through versions prior to 6.50.0 fail to sanitize the data placed in the JSON-LD HTML tag emitted by the {{ghost_head}} helper. An authenticated user with limited privileges can inject unescaped content that is rendered as script in the published page, potentially leading to compromise of a staff user's admin session when that user views the affected page.",
